# Temporary files

Put every agent scratch file in `.cursor/tmp/`. Delete it when the task that needed it is finished.

## Where

- Screenshots, OCR dumps, logs, and other scratch output go in `.cursor/tmp/`.
- Do not write `tmp-*` files at the top of `.cursor` or elsewhere in the repo.
- Do not commit anything under `.cursor/tmp/` (it is gitignored).

## After use

- Delete the files you created in `.cursor/tmp/` before ending the task.
- Leave the folder empty when nothing in it is still needed.

## Examples

- Simulator screenshot: `.cursor/tmp/pro-lesson.png`, then delete it after you have read it.
- A one-off note: `.cursor/tmp/notes.txt`, then delete it when the note is no longer needed.
